    "purpose": "Per-NB-arena bypass + guard flag picks for the nb_wave_bypass patch. Each entry maps a per-map .emevd file stem to (a) the XXXX2810 event ID where the WaitFor gate lives, (b) the bypass_flag that gets OR-injected into that WaitFor, and (c) the guard_flag used by common_func event 99055100 for idempotency.",
